.TH "GYRO" "1" "Nov 2026" "Gyro Hosting" "gyro manual"

.SH NAME
gyro-service-label-set - Set the nickname and/or tags of a service


.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBgyro service label set  [flags]\fP


.SH DESCRIPTION
Set the nickname and/or tags of a service

.PP
Send \fBnickname\fR, \fBtags\fR or both; a field that is not sent stays unchanged. \fBnickname\fR "" or null clears it; \fBtags\fR replaces all tags and \fB[]\fR clears them. A tag is \fB"name"\fR or \fB{"name", "color"}\fR; an unknown or missing colour gets a stable default. Duplicate names (case-insensitive) are merged. Limit: 30 label writes per minute per key (429 \fBrate_limited\fR). Sub-account keys need the \fBlabel:edit\fR action. Errors: 422 \fBnothing_to_update\fR, \fBinvalid_nickname\fR, \fBinvalid_tags\fR; 404 \fBservice_not_found\fR (also for services of other accounts) or \fBfeature_unavailable\fR\&.

.PP
API: PUT /cloud/services/{id}/label (operationId updateServiceLabel, scope services_write)


.SH OPTIONS
\fB--data\fP=""
	request body as JSON, @file or @- (stdin)

.PP
\fB--dry-run\fP[=false]
	show the price quote / request without changing anything

.PP
\fB-h\fP, \fB--help\fP[=false]
	help for set

.PP
\fB--idempotency-key\fP=""
	idempotency key (automatic for money operations)

.PP
\fB--nickname\fP=""
	"" or null clears the nickname. No control characters.

.PP
\fB--set\fP=[]
	extra body field key=value (repeatable)

.PP
\fB--tags\fP=[]
	Replaces all tags; [] or null clears them. Item: a tag name, or {"name", "color"} (CLI: use --data for colours).


.SH OPTIONS INHERITED FROM PARENT COMMANDS
\fB--api-url\fP=""
